  ⚠ svelte(valid-each-key): Expected key to use the variables which are defined by the `{#each}` block.
   ╭─[valid_each_key.tsx:1:25]
 1 │ {#each things as thing (foo)}{thing.name}{/each}
   ·                         ───
   ╰────
  help: Key the block by its own item or index, e.g. `(item.id)`; a key built from outside state or a constant cannot distinguish the rows.

